1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,225
Is aadmi ke haath mein jo sikka hai — woh TEEN SAU saal purana hai.

2
00:00:03,245 --> 00:00:04,785
Aur yeh aadmi israr kar raha hai...

3
00:00:04,804 --> 00:00:07,395
ke kal tak yehi sikka isi bazaar mein chalta tha.

4
00:00:08,304 --> 00:00:10,285
Woh jhoot nahi bol raha. Yeh qissa Quran ka hai.

5
00:00:10,304 --> 00:00:12,855
Aur is ke beech mein ek sawal hai — do lafzon ka:

6
00:00:13,054 --> 00:00:15,019
"Kam labithtum?" "Kitni der thehre?"

7
00:00:15,372 --> 00:00:17,269
Quran mein yeh sawal teen baar poocha gaya hai.

8
00:00:17,289 --> 00:00:19,858
Aur teeno baar — lafz ba lafz — ek hi jawab mila.

9
00:00:20,178 --> 00:00:22,442
Pehli baar... jawab SAU saal ghalat tha.

10
00:00:22,583 --> 00:00:24,189
Doosri baar... TEEN SAU saal.

11
00:00:24,493 --> 00:00:27,169
Aur teesri baar — yeh sawal abhi poocha jana baqi hai.

12
00:00:27,189 --> 00:00:29,928
Aur us din jawab dene walon mein... aap bhi ho sakte hain.

13
00:00:29,948 --> 00:00:30,658
Aur main bhi.

14
00:00:30,928 --> 00:00:33,843
Saal 2010. America. Colorado ki ek laboratory.

15
00:00:33,863 --> 00:00:36,472
Do ghadiyan — ek doosri se sirf ek foot oonchi.

16
00:00:36,753 --> 00:00:38,077
Aur dono ka waqt... alag.

17
00:00:38,427 --> 00:00:42,298
Yaani waqt aapke sar aur aapke pairon ke liye bhi ek raftaar se nahi chalta.

18
00:00:42,622 --> 00:00:43,038
Aaj:

19
00:00:43,058 --> 00:00:47,507
woh zarra jo har second aapki hatheli se guzarta hai — halanke usay raaste mein hi mar jana chahiye tha.

20
00:00:47,793 --> 00:00:49,467
Surah Kahf ka hisaab — "teen sau...

21
00:00:49,487 --> 00:00:51,962
aur nau" — jo aap khud calculator par nikalenge.

22
00:00:51,982 --> 00:00:55,323
Aur woh wajah jis se pichhle das saal... das mahinon mein guzar gaye.

23
00:00:55,343 --> 00:00:56,713
Aur ek shart.

24
00:00:57,003 --> 00:00:58,837
Is video ke dauran ghadi mat dekhiye.

25
00:00:58,857 --> 00:01:03,088
Aakhir mein main aapse ek seedha sa sawal poochunga — aur mujhe yaqeen hai, aapka jawab ghalat hoga.

26
00:01:03,392 --> 00:01:05,637
Aur kone mein jo ginti chal rahi hai? Woh ghadi nahi.

27
00:01:05,667 --> 00:01:07,975
Woh kya hai — yeh bhi aakhir mein bataunga.

28
00:01:10,665 --> 00:01:13,451
Pehla sawal. Surah Al-Baqarah, ayat number 259.

29
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:20,165
Ek shakhs — mashhoor qaul ke mutabiq Hazrat Uzair (alayhis-salam) — apne gadhe par sawar ho kar ek ujdi hui basti se guzarta hai.

30
00:01:20,730 --> 00:01:22,161
Chhatein zameen par giri hui hain.

31
00:01:22,471 --> 00:01:25,521
Galiyon mein sannata. Aur us ke dil se ek sawal nikalta hai:

32
00:01:25,751 --> 00:01:29,376
"Allah is basti ko marne ke baad dobara kaise zinda karega?"

33
00:01:29,713 --> 00:01:32,228
Jawab mein... Allah usay wahin maut de deta hai. Sau saal.

34
00:01:32,248 --> 00:01:34,439
Phir usay dobara zinda karta hai. Aur poochta hai:

35
00:01:34,558 --> 00:01:37,724
Surah Al-Baqarah ki ayat number 259 ka tarjuma:

36
00:01:37,938 --> 00:01:40,154
"Kam labitht?" — Tum kitni der thehre?

37
00:01:40,724 --> 00:01:43,183
Woh suraj ko dekhta hai — abhi ghuroob nahi hua. Aur kehta hai:

38
00:01:43,203 --> 00:01:45,034
"Ek din... ya din ka kuch hissa."

39
00:01:45,563 --> 00:01:46,978
"Nahi. Tum SAU SAAL thehre."

40
00:01:46,998 --> 00:01:49,169
Aur saboot us ke saamne rakh diya jata hai:

41
00:01:49,373 --> 00:01:52,289
Surah Al-Baqarah ki ayat number 259, jis ka tarjuma hai:

42
00:01:52,308 --> 00:01:55,329
"Apne khane ko dekho — is par saal guzre hi nahi.

43
00:01:55,528 --> 00:01:56,974
Aur apne gadhe ko dekho."

44
00:01:57,284 --> 00:01:59,558
Khana — jo ek din mein kharab ho jata hai — taaza.

45
00:01:59,578 --> 00:02:02,999
Gadha — jo wahin khada tha — haddiyon ka dher. Aur woh khud:

46
00:02:03,019 --> 00:02:06,519
"din ka kuch hissa." Ek hi jagah. Ek hi dhoop. Teen cheezein...

47
00:02:06,539 --> 00:02:07,569
aur teen alag waqt.

48
00:02:08,012 --> 00:02:11,871
Yeh mo'jiza tha. Lekin yeh ayat ek sawal chhod gayi: Kya waqt waqai...

49
00:02:11,891 --> 00:02:13,641
har cheez ke liye alag ho sakta hai?

50
00:02:13,997 --> 00:02:16,251
Sadiyon tak science ka jawab tha: hargiz nahi.

51
00:02:16,271 --> 00:02:22,981
Newton ke nazdeek waqt poori kainat mein ek hi raftaar se behta hai — mera ek second, aapka ek second, sab barabar hai.

52
00:02:23,382 --> 00:02:24,227
Phir Einstein aaya.

53
00:02:24,296 --> 00:02:28,127
Us ki equations ne do aisi baatein kahin jinhein aqal maan'ne ko tayyar nahi thi:

54
00:02:28,889 --> 00:02:31,234
jitni tez raftaar — utna sust waqt.

55
00:02:31,503 --> 00:02:34,129
Doosra: jitni zyada gravity — utna sust waqt.

56
00:02:34,408 --> 00:02:37,024
Aur yeh ghadi ki kharabi nahi. Waqt khud sust ho jata hai.

57
00:02:37,044 --> 00:02:40,414
Aapka dil dheere dhadakta hai — aur aapko kuch mehsoos nahi hota.

58
00:02:40,967 --> 00:02:42,277
"Yeh to sirf theory hai." — Nahi.

59
00:02:42,637 --> 00:02:44,682
Saal 1971. Washington.

60
00:02:44,764 --> 00:02:48,270
Do scientists ek aam musafir jahaz ke ticket khareedte hain.

61
00:02:48,384 --> 00:02:49,659
Do apne liye. Aur do...

62
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:53,287
ek aise musafir ke liye jis ka naam ticket par likha hai: "Mr. Clock."

63
00:02:53,307 --> 00:02:55,193
Mr. Clock insaan nahi.

64
00:02:55,763 --> 00:03:00,697
Woh atomic ghadiyan hain — seat par bandhi hui — jo duniya ka poora chakkar laga kar wapas aati hain.

65
00:03:00,717 --> 00:03:04,048
Unhein khana mila ya nahi — tareekh khamosh hai.

66
00:03:04,643 --> 00:03:07,423
Lekin un ka waqt... zameen par rakhi ghadi se alag nikla.

67
00:03:07,443 --> 00:03:13,332
Farq second ke arabwen hisson ka — aur taqreeban utna hi, jitna Einstein ne pehle se bata diya tha.

68
00:03:15,033 --> 00:03:16,908
Aur Colorado wali woh do ghadiyan?

69
00:03:16,929 --> 00:03:20,859
Oonchi wali tez chali — kyunke zameen se zara door, gravity zara kam thi.

70
00:03:21,163 --> 00:03:22,158
Is ka matlab samjhe?

71
00:03:22,179 --> 00:03:25,449
Is waqt aapka SAR aapke PAIRON se zyada tezi se boodha ho raha hai.

72
00:03:25,519 --> 00:03:30,408
Zindagi bhar mein farq ek second ke das lakhwen hisse se bhi kam — lekin hai.

73
00:03:31,033 --> 00:03:33,388
Aur gehrai mein jaiye to farq saalon ka ho jata hai:

74
00:03:33,408 --> 00:03:37,348
hisaab ke mutabiq zameen ka markaz us ki satah se DHAAI SAAL chhota hai.

75
00:03:37,368 --> 00:03:38,899
Ek hi sayyara — do umrein.

76
00:03:39,274 --> 00:03:41,599
Aur ab ek kaam kijiye. Apni hatheli kholiye.

77
00:03:41,736 --> 00:03:42,322
Sach mein.

78
00:03:43,514 --> 00:03:46,609
Abhi — is ek second mein — aapki hatheli ke aar-paar ek zarra guzar gaya.

79
00:03:46,629 --> 00:03:47,900
Jis ka naam hai: muon.

80
00:03:48,478 --> 00:03:49,568
Yeh zarra ek bhagoda hai.

81
00:03:49,841 --> 00:03:51,445
Isay yahan hona hi nahi chahiye.

82
00:03:52,282 --> 00:03:54,482
Yeh pandrah kilometer upar aasman mein paida hota hai.

83
00:03:54,502 --> 00:03:56,862
Is ki ausat umar: do microsecond.

84
00:03:56,883 --> 00:04:00,082
Roshni ki raftaar se bhi daude — to chhe sau saath meter mein khatam.

85
00:04:00,103 --> 00:04:03,373
Chhe sau saath meter. Aur safar... pandrah kilometer ka.

86
00:04:03,727 --> 00:04:05,781
Phir yeh aapki hatheli tak zinda kaise pohancha?

87
00:04:05,801 --> 00:04:08,671
Kyunke yeh itna tez hai ke is ki apni ghadi sust chal rahi hai.

88
00:04:08,849 --> 00:04:11,224
Hamari ghadi mein pachaas microsecond guzre.

89
00:04:11,245 --> 00:04:13,075
Is ki apni ghadi mein — sirf ek-do.

90
00:04:13,175 --> 00:04:16,979
Har second. Aapki hatheli par. Waqt ke sust hone ka zinda saboot hai.

91
00:04:17,394 --> 00:04:20,490
Aur abhi bhi shak ho — phone nikaliye. Google Maps ka neela nuqta.

92
00:04:20,509 --> 00:04:25,500
Us ke peeche jo satellites hain, un ki ghadiyan har roz 38 microsecond aage nikal jati hain.

93
00:04:25,925 --> 00:04:30,720
Engineers yeh farq theek na karein — to aapki location har roz das kilometer ghalat hoti jaye.

94
00:04:30,740 --> 00:04:33,909
Aur aapka rider khana le kar doosre shehar pohanch jaye.

95
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:36,745
To science ka faisla: kainat mein koi ek "master ghadi" nahi.

96
00:04:36,764 --> 00:04:41,145
Har cheez apni ghadi saath le kar chal rahi hai — physics isay "proper time" kehti hai:

97
00:04:41,165 --> 00:04:41,854
apna waqt.

98
00:04:42,154 --> 00:04:43,069
Insaaf ki baat:

99
00:04:43,089 --> 00:04:46,659
laboratory mein yeh farq second ke arabwen hisson ka hai, sau saal ka nahi.

100
00:04:46,730 --> 00:04:47,629
Woh waqia mo'jiza tha.

101
00:04:47,649 --> 00:04:50,919
Lekin "ek jagah, do alag waqt" — yeh ab physics ka pehla sabaq hai.

102
00:04:51,413 --> 00:04:53,747
Aur Quran ne yeh usool ek jumle mein keh rakha tha.

103
00:04:53,767 --> 00:04:56,528
Surah Al-Hajj ki ayat number 47, jis ka tarjuma hai:

104
00:04:56,548 --> 00:05:00,427
"Tumhare Rab ke haan ek din — tumhari ginti ke hazaar saal jaisa hai."

105
00:05:00,447 --> 00:05:04,057
"Tumhari ginti ke." Ginti tumhari hai. Paimana... ek nahi.

106
00:05:04,418 --> 00:05:05,633
Is ayat ko yaad rakhiye.

107
00:05:05,653 --> 00:05:08,427
Aakhir mein yeh wapas aayegi — ek calculator ke saath.

108
00:05:08,632 --> 00:05:10,028
Lekin yeh to ghadiyon ka waqt tha.

109
00:05:10,048 --> 00:05:12,388
Ek aur waqt hai — jo aapke sar ke ANDAR chalta hai.

110
00:05:12,408 --> 00:05:15,277
Aur wahan gadbad second ke arabwen hisse ki nahi... saalon ki hai.

111
00:05:16,418 --> 00:05:20,162
Doosra sawal. Surah Al-Kahf. Chand naujawan. Poori qaum un ke khilaf.

112
00:05:20,377 --> 00:05:23,242
Aur sirf do raaste: imaan chhod do — ya jaan de do.

113
00:05:23,773 --> 00:05:26,022
Woh shehar chhod kar ek ghaar mein panaah lete hain.

114
00:05:26,278 --> 00:05:29,162
Aur Allah un ke kaanon par neend ki mohar laga deta hai.

115
00:05:29,483 --> 00:05:31,387
Jab aankh khulti hai — to un mein se ek poochta hai...

116
00:05:31,497 --> 00:05:33,727
wohi sawal: "Kam labithtum?" — Kitni der thehre?

117
00:05:33,908 --> 00:05:35,312
Aur jawab — lafz ba lafz wohi:

118
00:05:35,442 --> 00:05:37,332
"Ek din... ya din ka kuch hissa."

119
00:05:37,757 --> 00:05:38,393
Bhook lagi hai.

120
00:05:38,413 --> 00:05:41,442
To ek saathi ko chaandi ka sikka de kar shehar bheja jata hai:

121
00:05:41,848 --> 00:05:44,192
"Khana le aao — aur dekhna, kisi ko hamari khabar na ho."

122
00:05:44,778 --> 00:05:46,642
Aur aap jaante hain bazaar mein kya hua.

123
00:05:47,173 --> 00:05:48,068
Riwayaton mein aata hai:

124
00:05:48,088 --> 00:05:50,228
dukaandar ne sikka dekha — aur shor mach gaya:

125
00:05:50,247 --> 00:05:53,432
"Is ke haath koi purana khazana laga hai!" Aur woh kehta raha:

126
00:05:53,452 --> 00:05:55,462
"Kal tak yehi sikka yahan chalta tha!"

127
00:05:55,858 --> 00:05:57,997
Woh jhoot nahi bol raha tha. Us ke liye... waqai kal tha.

128
00:05:58,017 --> 00:05:59,497
To asal mein kitna waqt guzra tha?

129
00:05:59,517 --> 00:06:02,673
Surah Al-Kahf ki ayat number pachees, jis ka tarjuma hai:

130
00:06:02,702 --> 00:06:06,897
"Woh apne ghaar mein teen sau saal rahe — aur nau aur badha diye gaye."

131
00:06:07,173 --> 00:06:10,597
Dobara suniye: "teen sau... aur nau." Seedha "teen sau nau" kyun nahi?

132
00:06:11,048 --> 00:06:12,783
Phone uthaiye. Calculator kholiye.

133
00:06:12,802 --> 00:06:14,752
Video pause kar lijiye — main yahin hoon.

134
00:06:15,048 --> 00:06:19,112
Suraj wala saal: 365.24 din. Isay 300 se zarb dijiye.

135
00:06:19,338 --> 00:06:22,082
Ab jawab ko chaand wale saal par taqseem kijiye:

136
00:06:22,307 --> 00:06:23,932
teen sau chauwan point saintees.

137
00:06:25,218 --> 00:06:26,702
Teen sau nau. Point do.

138
00:06:26,983 --> 00:06:29,747
Teen sau shamsi saal — barabar teen sau nau qamari saal.

139
00:06:29,892 --> 00:06:32,985
Ek hi muddat. Do calendar. Aur ayat ne dono ginti...

140
00:06:33,005 --> 00:06:34,155
ek jumle mein rakh di.

141
00:06:34,471 --> 00:06:35,406
Insaaf ki baat:

142
00:06:35,425 --> 00:06:43,091
yeh farq us zamane ke hisaab-daanon ko maloom tha, aur Imam Ibn Kathir ne saat sau saal pehle yehi likha.

143
00:06:43,110 --> 00:06:44,920
Kamaal hisaab ka nahi — bayan ka hai.

144
00:06:45,093 --> 00:06:47,318
Ginti badli, to number badal gaya.

145
00:06:47,463 --> 00:06:49,948
Waqt wohi raha. Lekin asal sawal to reh gaya.

146
00:06:50,057 --> 00:06:53,041
Teen sau saal guzar gaye — aur unhein laga: "ek din." Kyun?

147
00:06:53,322 --> 00:06:55,337
Jis ka kabhi operation hua ho — us se poochiye.

148
00:06:55,357 --> 00:06:58,277
Behoshi ke chaar ghante... ek pal. Aankh band hui. Aankh khuli.

149
00:06:58,297 --> 00:06:59,286
Beech mein — kuch nahi.

150
00:06:59,637 --> 00:07:02,652
Kyunke aapke jism mein roshni ke liye aankh hai. Awaaz ke liye kaan.

151
00:07:02,672 --> 00:07:05,081
Lekin waqt ko mehsoos karne wala koi hissa...

152
00:07:05,857 --> 00:07:07,566
Dimagh waqt ko BANATA hai. Yaadon se.

153
00:07:07,586 --> 00:07:09,655
Jitni nayi yaadein — utna lamba waqt.

154
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,036
Bachpan yaad kijiye.

155
00:07:11,055 --> 00:07:14,745
Har cheez pehli baar ho rahi thi — pehla school, pehli cycle, pehli Eid.

156
00:07:15,175 --> 00:07:16,960
Dimagh sab kuch likh raha tha.

157
00:07:17,314 --> 00:07:19,818
Is liye garmiyon ki chhuttiyan khatam hi nahi hoti thin.

158
00:07:20,098 --> 00:07:20,584
Aur ab?

159
00:07:20,754 --> 00:07:21,343
Wohi raasta.

160
00:07:21,494 --> 00:07:21,943
Wohi kaam.

161
00:07:22,113 --> 00:07:23,263
Wohi phone. Dimagh kehta hai:

162
00:07:23,314 --> 00:07:26,013
"Yeh sab dekha hua hai" — aur likhna band kar deta hai.

163
00:07:26,348 --> 00:07:28,264
Natija? Ramzan aata hai... aur chala jata hai.

164
00:07:28,283 --> 00:07:30,153
Pichhle das saal — das mahine.

165
00:07:30,512 --> 00:07:31,907
Ek model to yahan tak kehta hai:

166
00:07:31,927 --> 00:07:35,266
agar aap assi saal jiyein — to mehsoos ke hisaab se aapki AADHI zindagi...

167
00:07:35,286 --> 00:07:37,396
bees saal ki umar tak guzar chuki hoti hai.

168
00:07:38,252 --> 00:07:39,387
Aur ab yeh hadith suniye.

169
00:07:39,406 --> 00:07:43,916
Rasulullah ﷺ ne farmaya — Tirmidhi ki riwayat hai:

170
00:07:44,237 --> 00:07:46,672
"Qayamat qaim nahi hogi jab tak zamana simat na jaye.

171
00:07:46,692 --> 00:07:49,361
Saal — mahine jaisa ho jayega. Mahina — hafte jaisa.

172
00:07:49,576 --> 00:07:52,152
Hafta — din jaisa. Din — ek ghante jaisa. Aur ghanta...

173
00:07:52,172 --> 00:07:53,501
aag ki ek bhadak jaisa."

174
00:07:53,781 --> 00:07:56,697
Ulama ne is ka ek ma'ni yeh likha hai: waqt se barkat uth jayegi.

175
00:07:56,716 --> 00:07:59,626
Din wohi chaubees ghante ka — lekin haath kuch nahi aayega.

176
00:07:59,891 --> 00:08:01,887
Chaudah sau saal pehle. Do sawal ho gaye.

177
00:08:01,906 --> 00:08:03,536
Dono baar jawab ghalat nikla.

178
00:08:03,786 --> 00:08:05,411
Ab teesra. Aur is baar masla yeh hai...

179
00:08:05,521 --> 00:08:06,991
ke jawab ghalat nahi hoga.

180
00:08:07,927 --> 00:08:09,521
Teesra sawal abhi poocha nahi gaya.

181
00:08:09,541 --> 00:08:12,191
Phir bhi Quran isay aise sunata hai — jaise ho chuka.

182
00:08:12,437 --> 00:08:14,831
Ayat yeh nahi kehti: "woh kahenge." Kehti hai:

183
00:08:14,851 --> 00:08:18,186
"Qalu" — "unhon ne KAHA." Maazi ka seegha.

184
00:08:18,529 --> 00:08:19,465
Mufassireen batate hain:

185
00:08:19,485 --> 00:08:22,474
jo baat yaqeeni ho — Arabi usay maazi mein bayan karti hai.

186
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:24,155
Aur ek lamhe ko sochiye:

187
00:08:24,175 --> 00:08:27,745
jis ne waqt ko paida kiya — us ke saamne "hoga" aur "ho chuka" mein farq...

188
00:08:27,894 --> 00:08:28,384
hai hi kitna?

189
00:08:28,699 --> 00:08:31,304
Surah Al-Mu'minun. Maut ka lamha. Ek shakhs pukarta hai:

190
00:08:31,819 --> 00:08:33,455
"Mere Rab — mujhe wapas bhej de.

191
00:08:33,475 --> 00:08:36,084
Shayad main woh nek kaam kar loon jo chhod aaya hoon."

192
00:08:36,575 --> 00:08:39,175
Woh kya maang raha hai? Daulat nahi. Sehat nahi. Sirf ek cheez:

193
00:08:39,195 --> 00:08:40,144
thoda sa WAQT.

194
00:08:40,590 --> 00:08:41,215
Jawab:

195
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:43,064
"Kalla." — Hargiz nahi.

196
00:08:43,409 --> 00:08:46,325
Aur phir — usi surat mein, chand ayaton ke baad — wohi sawal.

197
00:08:46,345 --> 00:08:48,975
Teesri baar. Un se — jinhon ne apni zindagi ganwa di:

198
00:08:49,144 --> 00:08:52,440
"Tum zameen mein ginti ke kitne saal rahe?" Saath saal. Sattar saal.

199
00:08:52,460 --> 00:08:55,429
Padhai. Naukri. Shaadi. Bachche. Pareshaniyan. Khwab.

200
00:08:55,855 --> 00:08:57,319
Aur jawab — lafz ba lafz wohi:

201
00:08:57,429 --> 00:08:59,199
"Ek din... ya din ka kuch hissa.

202
00:08:59,509 --> 00:09:01,074
Ginne walon se pooch lijiye."

203
00:09:01,413 --> 00:09:04,269
Pehli baar tasheeh hui thi: "Nahi — sau saal." Doosri baar:

204
00:09:04,288 --> 00:09:05,418
"Teen sau — aur nau."

205
00:09:05,678 --> 00:09:07,803
Aur is baar? Is baar koi tasheeh nahi.

206
00:09:08,129 --> 00:09:10,563
Surah Al-Mu'minun mein aata hai: "Tum thodi der thehre.

207
00:09:10,583 --> 00:09:11,833
KAASH tum jaante."

208
00:09:12,269 --> 00:09:17,288
Aur Quran yeh manzar baar baar dikhata hai — aur har baar ginti chhoti hoti jati hai.

209
00:09:17,749 --> 00:09:21,941
Koi kahega: "Das din." Un mein jo sab se samajhdar hoga — kahega:

210
00:09:21,961 --> 00:09:24,920
"Sirf ek din." Phir: "Din ki ghadi." Phir: "Ek shaam...

211
00:09:25,091 --> 00:09:25,760
ya us ki subah."

212
00:09:26,166 --> 00:09:27,581
Ab woh ayat yaad kijiye:

213
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:31,346
"ek din — tumhari ginti ke hazaar saal jaisa." Calculator uthaiye.

214
00:09:31,365 --> 00:09:33,015
Aakhri baar.

215
00:09:33,350 --> 00:09:35,956
Sattar saal ki zindagi. Hazaar par taqseem kijiye.

216
00:09:36,010 --> 00:09:37,615
Phir chaubees se zarb dijiye.

217
00:09:37,730 --> 00:09:38,956
Ek point chhe aath.

218
00:09:39,350 --> 00:09:43,855
Yaani us paimane par aapki poori zindagi — ek ghanta ektalees minute.

219
00:09:43,875 --> 00:09:45,125
"Din ka kuch hissa."

220
00:09:45,350 --> 00:09:49,775
Aur Quran ek aur din ka zikr karta hai — jis ki miqdaar pachaas hazaar saal hai.

221
00:09:49,806 --> 00:09:51,956
Us paimane par? Sattar saal... do minute.

222
00:09:52,515 --> 00:09:54,776
Yeh hisaab tafsir nahi — sirf andaza lagane ke liye.

223
00:09:54,796 --> 00:09:56,346
Lekin andaza ho gaya hoga.

224
00:09:56,581 --> 00:09:57,745
"Kaash tum jaante."

225
00:09:58,081 --> 00:10:00,615
Ab ruk kar sochiye: yeh ayat kis ko sunayi ja rahi hai?

226
00:10:00,635 --> 00:10:02,466
Un ko nahi — jin se sawal ho chuka.

227
00:10:02,941 --> 00:10:05,521
Yeh AAPKO sunayi ja rahi hai. Aaj. Yaani imtihan se pehle...

228
00:10:05,541 --> 00:10:06,790
parcha aapke haath mein hai.

229
00:10:07,186 --> 00:10:08,730
Aur agli hi ayat poochti hai:

230
00:10:09,255 --> 00:10:15,346
"To kya tum ne yeh samjha tha ke Hum ne tumhein be-maqsad paida kiya hai — aur tum Hamari taraf lautaye nahi jaoge?"

231
00:10:16,206 --> 00:10:17,201
Aur ab achhi khabar.

232
00:10:17,221 --> 00:10:22,680
Jis Quran ne sattar saal ko "din ka kuch hissa" kaha — usi Quran ne ek raat ke baare mein kaha:

233
00:10:22,985 --> 00:10:25,130
Surah Al-Qadr ki ayat hai, jis ka tarjuma:

234
00:10:25,370 --> 00:10:28,406
"Laylat-ul-Qadr hazaar mahinon se behtar hai." Hazaar mahine:

235
00:10:28,426 --> 00:10:30,255
tiraasi saal, chaar mahine.

236
00:10:30,581 --> 00:10:32,645
Ek raat... ek poori zindagi se bhaari.

237
00:10:32,926 --> 00:10:34,961
Yaani waqt ki LAMBAI aapke haath mein nahi.

238
00:10:34,980 --> 00:10:36,750
Waqt ka WAZAN aapke haath mein hai.

239
00:10:37,181 --> 00:10:40,605
Aur wazan kaise badhta hai — is ke liye Allah ne poori ek surat utari hai.

240
00:10:41,030 --> 00:10:43,535
Aur us ki ibtida mein khud waqt ki qasam khayi hai:

241
00:10:43,956 --> 00:10:46,490
Surah Al-Asr, jis ka tarjuma: "Zamane ki qasam.

242
00:10:46,510 --> 00:10:48,260
Beshak insaan khasare mein hai.

243
00:10:48,666 --> 00:10:55,250
Siwaye un ke — jo imaan laye, nek amal kiye, ek doosre ko haq ki naseehat ki, aur sabr ki naseehat ki."

244
00:10:55,576 --> 00:10:57,091
Chaar kaam. Imam Shafi'i ne kaha:

245
00:10:57,110 --> 00:11:00,885
agar log sirf isi ek surat par ghaur kar lein — to yehi un ke liye kaafi hai.

246
00:11:02,005 --> 00:11:04,562
Aur ab — meri shart. Yaad hai? Bina dekhe bataiye:

247
00:11:04,581 --> 00:11:06,030
yeh video shuru hue kitni der hui?

248
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,447
Jawab screen par hai.

249
00:11:10,620 --> 00:11:12,377
Aapka andaza kam nikla — ya zyada?

250
00:11:12,397 --> 00:11:14,106
Dono soorton mein ek baat sabit hui:

251
00:11:14,645 --> 00:11:16,911
aapke andar waqt naapne wali koi ghadi nahi.

252
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,125
Lekin ek ghadi hai.

253
00:11:18,797 --> 00:11:22,305
Woh ginti — jo pehle second se kone mein chal rahi hai — woh aapke dil ki dhadkanein hain.

254
00:11:22,721 --> 00:11:25,086
Itni baar aapka dil is video mein dhadak chuka hai.

255
00:11:25,436 --> 00:11:28,480
Poori zindagi mein yeh taqreeban dhaai arab baar dhadakta hai.

256
00:11:28,755 --> 00:11:30,680
Aur yeh ginti... sirf ek taraf chalti hai.

257
00:11:31,100 --> 00:11:34,326
Hasan Basri ne kaha tha: "Ae Ibn-e-Adam! Tu chand dinon ka majmua hai.

258
00:11:34,485 --> 00:11:37,201
Jab ek din guzarta hai — to tera ek hissa guzar jata hai."

259
00:11:37,221 --> 00:11:39,670
Aapke paas waqt nahi. Aap KHUD waqt hain.

260
00:11:40,971 --> 00:11:42,225
Is video ke baad ek kaam:

261
00:11:42,245 --> 00:11:45,895
jis kaam ko — ya jis insaan ko — aap ne "kabhi fursat mein" keh ke taal rakha hai...

262
00:11:46,216 --> 00:11:47,461
aaj hi kar lijiye.

263
00:11:47,740 --> 00:11:50,485
Aur agli video mein baat waqt ki nahi — tarteeb ki hogi.

264
00:11:50,635 --> 00:11:52,740
Surah Baqarah mein 286 ayaat hain.

265
00:11:53,096 --> 00:11:54,860
Aadha kijiye: ek sau taintalees.

266
00:11:54,969 --> 00:11:58,324
Ab ayat number 143 khol kar dekhiye — us mein ek lafz hai...

267
00:11:58,344 --> 00:12:01,692
jis ka matlab hai: "darmiyan." Aur yeh to sirf pehli parat hai.

268
00:12:01,966 --> 00:12:03,552
Screen par mulaqat hogi.

